        O APK fica em <a href="https://github.com/DiegoFogari/luuharts-3d/releases" style="color:var(--cyan)">GitHub Releases</a>.
        No celular: abra o link → permita instalar de fontes desconhecidas → instalar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>LuuhArt's 3D · Araras-SP</p>
      <p><a href="https://wa.me/5516997828851">WhatsApp (16) 99782-8851 — Luiza Helena</a></p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/DiegoFogari">github.com/DiegoFogari</a></p>
